Subject: [PATCH] Eturlia: placeNewPlayer body in vanilla 3-arg for Sable UDP

Sable UDP injects AFTER first ServerGamePacketListenerImpl.send inside
placeNewPlayer. Keep the login body on the 3-arg form; Paper extras via
ThreadLocal from placeNewPlayerWithSpawn.

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/players/PlayerList.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/players/PlayerList.java
index 542d44dcad5dd9c7e3be549b1cddb1f4f8dbf5af..3a06a13e88759c35f5cc821528d5faca3e9330de 100644
